{"path":"io/c/getchar","title":"std::getchar","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>getchar","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/c/getchar","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Reads the next character from stdin.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cstdio\">&lt;cstdio&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> getchar<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Reads the next character from <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/std_streams\">stdin</a></span>.\n</p><p>Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/fgetc\"><span class=\"kw1839\">std::<span class=\"me2\">getc</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">stdin</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The obtained character on success or <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c\">EOF</a></span> on failure. \n</p><p>If the failure has been caused by end of file condition, additionally sets the <i>eof</i> indicator (see <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/feof\">std::feof()</a></span>) on <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/std_streams\">stdin</a></span>. If the failure has been caused by some other error, sets the <i>error</i> indicator (see <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/ferror\">std::ferror()</a></span>) on <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/std_streams\">stdin</a></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<p><code>std::getchar</code> with error checking. Exit program by entering ESC char.\n</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cctype&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdio&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdlib&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> ch<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>ch <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">getchar</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c\"><span class=\"kw1898\">EOF</span></a> <span class=\"sy4\">;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"co1\">// read/print \"abc\" from stdin</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/isprint\"><span class=\"kw3610\">std::<span class=\"me2\">isprint</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>ch<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">static_cast</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>ch<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>ch <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">27</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"co1\">// 'ESC' (escape) in ASCII</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/EXIT_status\"><span class=\"kw976\">EXIT_SUCCESS</span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// Test reason for reaching EOF.</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/feof\"><span class=\"kw1887\">std::<span class=\"me2\">feof</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">stdin</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"co1\">// if failure caused by end-of-file condition</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"End of file reached<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">else</span> <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/ferror\"><span class=\"kw1888\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ferror</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">stdin</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"co1\">// if failure caused by some other error</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/perror\"><span class=\"kw1889\">std::<span class=\"me2\">perror</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"getchar()\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cerr\"><span class=\"kw1777\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cerr</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"getchar() failed in file \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/quoted\"><span class=\"kw1819\">std::<span class=\"me2\">quoted</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>__FILE__<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n                  <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" at line # \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> __LINE__ <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">14</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/exit\"><span class=\"kw971\">std::<span class=\"me2\">exit</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/EXIT_status\"><span class=\"kw977\">EXIT_FAILURE</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/EXIT_status\"><span class=\"kw976\">EXIT_SUCCESS</span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code>abc\na\nb\nc\n<span class=\"sy3\">^</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/fgetc\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>fgetc</span><span>getc</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  gets a character from a file stream <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/io/getchar\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>getchar</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/c","title":"C-style file input/output"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::getchar","chi